# The cluster this build expects. The fail-closed network gate verifies the RPC's genesis
# hash against it and blocks on a mismatch. 'devnet' | 'mainnet-beta' (NOT 'mainnet').
# A mainnet APK build MUST set mainnet-beta (EAS production profile already does — eas.json).
EXPO_PUBLIC_EXPECTED_CLUSTER=devnet
